Use arcane forces to summon [3, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] meteors that fall to the ground within range 2 of the target.

Each meteor smashes everything within radius 2, dealing [76, 103, 123, 141, 156 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire and [76, 103, 123, 141, 156 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage to creatures other than yourself, while liquefying some of the terrain into lava for 8 turns.

The damage increases with your Spellpower.
